option.SUNLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts the strength of direct sunlight. 100 = default.
option.MOONLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts the strength of moonlight at night. 100 = default.
option.SKYLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Determines the strength of directional ambient light from the sky.
option.MIN_AMBIENT.comment=Determines the ambient light floor in dark areas, so caves never go pitch black.
option.BLOCKLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts the strength of light emitted by torches, lava, glowstone and other light source blocks.
option.BLOCKLIGHT_SUPPRESSION.comment=Enables blocklight fading as daylight gets stronger; replaces auto-exposure without flicker.
option.HANDHELD_LIGHTING.comment=Enables dynamic light around the player while holding a light-emitting block.
option.HANDHELD_LIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts the intensity of the handheld dynamic light.
option.LIGHTNING_FLASH.comment=Enables lightning bolts lighting up the surroundings and the sky.
option.EMISSIVE_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts the boost applied to emissive surfaces (glowstone, lava, portals...).
option.SHADOWS.comment=Master switch for the shadow map. §c[-]§r One of the most expensive features overall.
option.SHADOW_RESOLUTION.comment=Adjusts the shadow map resolution. §c[-]§r Increasing this setting can impact performance.
option.SHADOW_DISTANCE.comment=Adjusts the distance real-time shadows are rendered, in blocks. §c[-]§r Increasing this setting can impact performance.
option.ENTITY_SHADOW_DISTANCE.comment=Determines the distance at which entities cast shadows.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=Determines the edge softening radius of the shadow filter, in texels (max 16).
option.COLORED_SHADOWS.comment=Enables tinted shadows cast by stained glass and water; clear glass casts none.
option.STATIC_SHADOW_FALLBACK.comment=Enables a skylight-based shadow approximation beyond the shadow distance, blended over 5-10 blocks.
option.SSS_FOLIAGE.comment=Enables leaves and plants to let some light through from behind.
option.SSS_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts the intensity of the foliage translucency effect.
option.SKY_MODE.comment=Determines how the sky is rendered. The simple gradient is the fastest option.
option.SUN_MOON_MODE.comment=Determines the style of the sun and moon.
option.STARS.comment=Enables the night star field with subtle twinkle.
option.CLOUD_MODE.comment=Determines how clouds are rendered. Vanilla clouds are retinted; the planar style is low cost.
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE.comment=Determines the coverage of the planar cloud layer. §e[*]§r Only works when Clouds is set to the planar style.
option.AIR_PERSPECTIVE.comment=Enables a warm horizon tint toward the sun at sunrise/sunset, varying with view angle.
option.BIOME_TINT.comment=Enables subtle tinting of fog and ambient light by biome temperature/humidity.
option.BIOME_TINT_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts the intensity of the biome tint.
option.END_NEBULA.comment=Enables a faint nebula layer in the End sky.
option.WATER_WAVES.comment=Enables animated water surface normals.
option.WATER_WAVE_HEIGHT.comment=Determines the amplitude of water waves.
option.WATER_WAVE_SPEED.comment=Determines the flow speed of the water surface.
option.SCREENSPACE_REFLECTIONS.comment=Enables SSR on water and ice top faces; falls back to sky reflection. §c[-]§r High cost when many reflective surfaces are on screen.
option.SCREENSPACE_REFRACTION.comment=Enables refraction under the water surface with per-tap depth and side rejection.
option.REFRACTION_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts the distortion strength of the refracted background. Water depth does not amplify it further.
option.WATER_ABSORPTION.comment=Determines how fast water absorbs light colors underwater; 0 = off.
option.WATER_CHARACTER.comment=Determines the water color palette.
option.WATER_CAUSTICS.comment=Enables caustic light patterns on the seafloor, cast along with shadows and fading with depth.
option.UNDERWATER_PARTICLES.comment=Enables suspended particles while underwater.
option.FANCY_TRANSLUCENTS.comment=Enables premultiplied-alpha blending for water and translucent blocks; lets reflections and refraction mix freely.
option.FOG_DENSITY.comment=Adjusts the density of distance fog.
option.SKY_FOG_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts how much near/mid fog blends into the sky color. The far horizon always converges to sky.
option.BORDER_FOG.comment=Enables fog at the edges of the loaded world to hide chunk borders.
option.CAVE_FOG.comment=Enables extra fog in deep underground areas.
option.UNDERWATER_FOG_DENSITY.comment=Adjusts the density of underwater fog.
option.NETHER_FOG_DENSITY.comment=Adjusts Nether fog density, which uses its own height and density curve.
option.END_FOG_DENSITY.comment=Adjusts the density of the End void fog gradient.
option.TONEMAP_OPERATOR.comment=Determines the tone mapping curve.
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Adjusts the overall brightness of the image.
option.SATURATION.comment=Adjusts overall colorfulness of the image.
option.VIBRANCE.comment=Adjusts the colorfulness of the image, but already colorful pixels are less affected.
option.CONTRAST.comment=Adjusts the darkness of dark colors and brightness of bright colors.
option.COLOR_TEMPERATURE.comment=Adjusts the warm/cool balance of the image. Negative = cooler.
option.BLOOM.comment=Enables a soft glow around bright areas.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts the intensity of the bloom.
option.GODRAYS.comment=Enables volumetric light shafts when looking at the sun/moon through gaps. §c[-]§r This effect can impact performance.
option.GODRAYS_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts the intensity of the godrays.
option.DITHERING.comment=Applies interleaved gradient noise on the output to remove banding. §e[*]§r Keep it on when no anti-aliasing is used.
option.VIGNETTE.comment=Darkens the corners of the screen.
option.WAVING_FOLIAGE.comment=Enables vertex-animated sway for leaves and plants.
option.WAVING_FOLIAGE_STRENGTH.comment=Determines the amplitude of the foliage sway.
option.VOXY_SUPPORT.comment=Enables rendering Voxy distant chunks with Astra lighting. §e[*]§r Experimental on 26.x.

